  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math>, then the value of $\\frac{a_{8}}{a_{12}},$ is"
  },
